<table align='CENTER' cellpadding='2' border='1' cellspacing='2' background='http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif'><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=6&y=2002">This Month</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=5&y=2002">May-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=4&y=2002">April-2002</A></TD></TR><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=3&y=2002">March-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=2&y=2002">February-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=1&y=2002">January-2002</A></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><CENTER><font size=+2>April, 2002</font><BR></center><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>FEAR</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Saturday - April 20th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Yuppers, our first fear raid :><BR>
Bonecaster from <a href="http://www.harmonyofsouls.org" target="_hoshome">Harmony of Souls</a> was kind enough to lead the raid for the astounding nine hours we were there.  For those of you that had never been in fear, I'll tell you that this raid went VERY smoothly.  We had a little CR on the break-in but that was about it.  It took maybe half an hour or perhaps 45 minutes for some.  There have been Fear Break-in's alone that took 8 hours.  There have even been the horror stories of 18hour break-in's with 3 un-rezzable corpses.  If you don't believe me, raid Fear more often :><BR>
We did a great job and I certainly hada  great time.  We were able to take down Dread with the mere 3 groups we had on hand.  Turns out that Fright's stun proc was just too much for us though.  I think we got him down to about half.  Many were amazed when we were able to take Terror down to his name in remaining HP :>  It was a very good accomplishment and you should feel proud.<BR>
At the end, <a href="http://www.harmonyofsouls.org" target="_hoshome">Harmony of Souls</a> was kind enough to add 3 more groups to our party.  We finished off Fright, Terror, and spanked the Broken Golem while we were there (<A href="http://pub27.ezboard.com/fharmonyofsouls36932frm8.showMessage?topicID=3707.topic" target="_grtzkyrnos">gratz Krynos</A>).<BR>
Here's what the loot looked like:<BR>
